      ],
      "name": "2INTO9 Story & Comfort",
      "settings": {
        "first_eyebrow": "Our Process",
        "first_heading": "Where Better Begins",
        "first_content": "<p>We believe good design starts with asking what isn't working.</p><p>Where does the product shift? Where does it restrict movement? Where do people adjust, compensate, or simply put up with discomfort?</p><p>From there, every detail gets a job. Considered construction, anatomical support, and carefully selected fabrics all come from solving a real use case, not adding features for show.</p><p>The goal is simple: less managing what you wear, more getting on with your day.</p>",
        "first_image": "shopify://shop_images/2INTO9_Boxer_Briefs_on_Cream_Pedestal.webp",
        "second_eyebrow": "Everyday Performance",
        "second_heading": "Built for the Day,\nNot the Display",
        "second_content": "<p>Daily wear has to perform beyond the first few hours of the day.</p><p>That means thinking about long hours, movement, changing conditions, and repeated use.</p>",
        "second_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dusk_Runway_Garden_Leap.webp",
        "show_benefits": true,
        "benefits_title": "RELAX, IT'S HANDLED:",
        "second_closing": "<p><strong>Take away the logo, branding and shelf appeal, and the product still has to prove itself.</strong> What really matters is the experience it adds to your everyday life.</p>",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#171717",
        "benefits_bg": "#f3f1ef",
        "image_ratio": "1 / 1",
        "max_width": 1360,
        "vertical_padding": 64,
        "mobile_padding": 40,
        "row_spacing": 64
      }
    },
