      "blocks": {
        "feature_JYngdh": {
          "type": "feature",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where Better Begins",
            "text": "<p>We believe good design starts with asking what isn't working. Where does the product shift? Where does it restrict movement? Where do people adjust, compensate, or simply put up with discomfort?</p><p>From there, every detail gets a job. Considered construction, anatomical support, and carefully selected fabrics all come from solving a real use case, not adding features for show.&nbsp;</p><p>The goal is simple: less managing what you wear, more getting on with your day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "feature_1": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "QUALITY MATERIALS & CRAFTSMANSHIP",
            "text": "<p>We have searched the globe, leaving no stone unturned in order to find the most exquisite blends of quality fabrics to use in our products. Our catalog features a wide variety of fabric blends, all of which have been strenuously tested to ensure long-lasting comfort and moisture prevention in even the most extreme circumstances.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CRAFTSMANSHIP.webp"
          }
        },
        "feature_2": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "LUXURY LIKE NO OTHER",
            "text": "<p>Scientifically-engineered and carefully crafted, our isolation pouch technology provides a level of comfort never before conceived. Available in both Single Pouch and Dual Pouch iterations, our designs excel in maintaining a cool, dry and chafe-free environment.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Luxury.webp"
          }
        },
        "feature_3": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "REVOLUTIONARY BY DESIGN",
            "text": "<p>We can go on about our superior craftsmanship, calculative design and stylish appearance, but nothing will convince you quite like slipping into a pair of 2INTO9 Underwear for yourself. It feels as if the jewels are being treated like royalty, given their own private sanctum which keeps them secure and you in a state of bliss.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/modern_design.webp"
          }
        }
      },
